# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER hardcode or commit real keys)
#
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 4. Generate and copy your demo key, then paste it below:
#
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Address Validation API, Routes API, Maps Static API
# Restrict by HTTP referrer (for Maps JS) and IP/API restrictions in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
